# The Timeline panel on examples/40-cinematic (ADR 0204): its player found by
# name, the panel opened from the command palette, the ruler pressed.
# Coordinates are a 1600 by 900 frame's.
wait 60
click 170 106
wait 4
text Meeting
wait 12
click 132 155
wait 8
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 8
text Timeline
wait 8
key enter
wait 30
shot timeline-open
click 1011 685
wait 20
shot timeline-scrubbed
quit
